Z||000000||Fiasco||05-13-2000||01:46 AM||||I'll probably jinx myself by spoutin' off about it, but I just hadta share...<BR>Just put in a new egr vac reg solenoid and it appears that I've finally got code 32 licked!<BR>It started with a cracked egr tube- replaced it- code gone for awhile, then came back. Troubleshooting ruled out solenoid, EGR valve itself was shot. -Code was gone for a couple hours... replaced that and still got 32. Apparently the troubleshooting needs some work.  Replaced solenoid the other day and have put a few hundred miles on and finally no codes!<BR>(probably about time for the tube to crack again, though, eh? )||||reg||10
